D.3
PER-TASK BATCH SIZES
Given the large number of hyperparameters to tune, and to avoid conﬂating variables, we ﬁx the batch
size at a per-task level. When comparing centralized training to federated training in Section 5, we
use the same batch size in both federated and centralized training.
